# Onboarding doc - mdshare sync

Master copy: `novopay-platform-creditcard-management/docs/guides/product-onboarding.md` (GitHub `trusttai/trustt-platform-creditcard-management`). Edit on a `ddp-fea-*` branch off `origin/ddp-prod`, PR to `ddp-prod`.

mdshare copy (published view): id `6abd71df5c3812e8ca51ab39` - [link](https://mdshare.trustt.com/md/s/7NmufeEoyqRx) (personal workspace)

## Do

- After **any** edit to the repo file, in the same turn, call mdshare `update_doc` with id `6abd71df5c3812e8ca51ab39` and the **full** new file content (not a diff).
- Before updating, `read_doc` the id. If `hasUnpublishedChanges` is true or `update_doc` returns `DRAFT_DIRTY`, stop and tell the user - do not overwrite someone else's draft.
- Keep the title unless the user asks to rename it. Keep tags `onboarding`, `cc`, `loc`, `aoc`, `eso`, `product`, `qa`.
- Refresh the **Source** line (prod branch + date) when content is re-derived from prod code.
- Tell the user: `update_doc` saves a **draft**; the share link shows it only after they press **Publish** in mdshare.

## Do not

- Do not create a new mdshare doc for an edit (no duplicates).
- Do not edit the mdshare copy without also editing the repo file.
- Do not keep or recreate a Desktop-level copy (`Desktop/novopay/docs/PRODUCT_ONBOARDING_CC_LOC_AOC.md` was retired).
- Style stays: visual first (mermaid + tables), minimal text, no code references, ASCII hyphens only.
